          <p class="spiel-text">Our clients typically spend around two weeks integrating with exchanges using Fix8 UFE rather than 10-16 weeks with other FIX engines (We target 80% reduction in development time).
          Check out this license free <a href="https://github.com/fix8mt/fix8pro_example/tree/dd8603eef63d71aa3d87574a688b4fc0fa592875" rel="noopener">example</a>.</p><p class="spiel-text">We aim to reduce the time and resources clients spend integrating with exchanges and instead allow them to focus on their execution strategies.</p></div><div xs="0" class="col-sm-0 col-md-0 col-lg-2 col-xl-2"></div><div class="spiel-left spiel col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-5 col-xl-5"><h3>We're here to help</h3><div class="spiel-icon-container"><img alt="Questions" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg fill='none' viewBox='0 0 512 512' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cfilter id='__svg-blur-2dba4ffa6141c14713c0a58c2abc0564'%3e%3cfeGaussianBlur in='SourceGraphic' stdDeviation='40'/%3e%3c/filter%3e%3c/defs%3e%3cimage x='0' y='0' filter='url(%23__svg-blur-2dba4ffa6141c14713c0a58c2abc0564)' width='512' height='512' xlink:href='data:image/svg%2bxml%3bbase64%2ciVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAEAAAABACAYAAACqaXHeAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAHKklEQVR42u1bCWxVRRR9/b/95XeBajc02GJFo1RFbEFR4kKISxRBWawrFayCSiEaNRLXxBhRRGohJEJAY4JEBVMNYqJxQU3EpaVg3CtuYHClFaSopd5JzrWXYf789/77/X1tmeTkv7kz896b%2b%2b/cuffOfY5zqPxf0vogXJVQP/hj45YBhGJCIaHIJYqBogCiEO%2bW62byEwk/EfYR9hLaBfYB7QbsBtoDjFZCbTxJ%2bJXQSdgl0IrJtaIur7m9E2jTxgYFf%2bD9/iWU2pjQiQmpThHCQEIW2jKxPHiZDMRvAaRG3fwEQgbELTsAyMH7q3fdgvlV2vSd6vAnIU%2bjzyGsJ7xKuAPM4aImvAMMGBJgBbgZ8zvVDQMKUQ8TGoSIM94WkpElJKC0pzV4jDHphGYvDChG/TrQviVUQUl%2bBtrt6JMjGHA0aGMIqwgrfGI54RnCJT6YwH%2bkJwYUob4atHmiz1TQXkY9CgZ0EI4Brd4gNX7wek8x4CbC11BuXG5Av3WGJTAUtCMI16OvDkWfCcTqw6ghzCYcL0Q57BJpfhhQoA12oD3vJfyMfjPFEmAlWBJQy88zA/K1Tkrr/yJEcpUYExUMYAk4nDCZcDlhmkCV6KPKsYQrsKymWTCFcJkHqGcP9iMB%2bYY1N4OwBA/QTecdmg543LKe3zBsTd2BhmQzIB17vqN5WFICeBcYDyW5DniRsJbwCmG6uOfNoK1Fn2SAn1OVDB0QEr9fwkocpLVFU2QHpFQHHGZoWwmx0gdGhAQc5XO76s7imgHqXz4Sk8gE0oXYhwU9DIlgBgwTeiEi%2bklENGR2E/jeGZDSZje%2bQBs6bSO0EL6Jgxb07cC4712OSzVahHIss0npNVgCXjXu34gVdAYY/xDucbNElR9wIqw/tygH