model you have the freedom to move.</p></div><div xs="0" class="col-sm-0 col-md-0 col-lg-2 col-xl-2"></div><div class="spiel-left spiel col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-5 col-xl-5"><h3>Lightning fast</h3><div class="spiel-icon-container"><img alt="Lightning fast" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg fill='none' viewBox='0 0 64 80' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cfilter id='__svg-blur-6d0376a20c3346ed5903ce42038d6635'%3e%3cfeGaussianBlur in='SourceGraphic' stdDeviation='40'/%3e%3c/filter%3e%3c/defs%3e%3cimage x='0' y='0' filter='url(%23__svg-blur-6d0376a20c3346ed5903ce42038d6635)' width='64' height='80' xlink:href='data:image/svg%2bxml%3bbase64%2ciVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAEAAAABQCAYAAACpv3NFAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAF/klEQVR42u1bb2wURRSfO%2b5aq2AQDYi0iAlYFYxEidGoRMsH0VK0amqNRNFEk4Kk0RjRT8YokjaRgFY%2bGD%2bYaEDlX4KmEP81LYr6RcUi1qhYi4gSUWlBQCvne%2bE3uZfJ3t7c3nq3e5mX/NKdufdmd3478%2bbNm61STpzkkiZCD%2bEIIRNzcB8%2bICyw7fyzFdDpXHjG5s2z4gnCY4TzKmA0cx%2bWo0%2bZfCOhB0rLK3BaP46%2bve%2bnNAIl/eY/qoBhv0OMBC4P%2bxGgjcxy3JGrf9YExFUcAY4AR0D0CZiLAKWPMEQ4iujtayzLTxEurzQCEoTFhN0FePIBwu2wjTUBF2Jt1m0PEtYQ5hOmE84ALiLcROgi7BP6HJtMiysBDYTf0eaPhPsIKQs71nmAsB%2b2BzF1YkXADSIe30IYj/oqQgthHYb5EWAAdS3QYRlH2Cr2K3PjQsAM8ea7xDy%2bjfC9xfz/jtAMmyThBTESLog6AdzZXrTzBjrA6BTt9xPaCTOFD5iJun6h1yHstwqfkIgSAWOwpPXi%2bh608bMY9p1iGC9Bh/zae0hMnw7Un4k2MxhJkSGgWdjx9S5c3y2Gve58g2GbBnl9HqTMEyTciroHUd4TJQL6hN1P4u2n4cz0nF/iYdsubBd6/L4Mv32L9lLiHrOjQMAc6P8BZIxh2yLm/BjD9mzhKBnv5pgOOni6A3UvovxkFAhYJzrcIexvMX5v97Dtwm%2b9SMycJFziofcw9F5DudEn01NSAuoIfwN8XUsYhf1U6HyDstkxLv8D8PVa6K31uM8sERorRIyyXDYCOo03o0BGRgQyOuU21rDdjvrnRbh8EhujCYbuOOiOoDzWKJeFAF63D0H3SlGvvXY1yodRrhE6C1DH8/8cUf8O6h8x7nW68DMKben8f9kI0N65z6g/gPo6lPt9oj3TLzTliQ53iamnN1X/GwG2aM6xJM5H%2bXWfzG3asE2KCNIL66F3cymSojbo9Vja9ErQiXKrWAaTAcJqtvkSbbSi7rkoZ4Wvg/0QyKkWe/u2AO21ifaqEQgNoe6qKG6GEmLpW2zM7ePYItvK9bCRx1uLUP4qyrtB/ZD7hZdfg7pjhKV5pkMSYfMx2KwSmyH99u%2bKMgFJlT1iewujgrHa8OhMxMVY5mpwzR3/Quitgm0SW2uu%2bzhq22EvmSrihJeFs2xC