tatic/intersect.8827e8a.a8601b3ee772100332f0792d735b1a9c.svg 682w" data-sizes="(max-width: 682px) 100vw, 682px" class="spiel-icon g-image g-image--lazy g-image--loading"><noscript><img src="/assets/static/intersect.8827e8a.a8601b3ee772100332f0792d735b1a9c.svg" class="spiel-icon g-image g-image--loaded" width="682" alt="Intersect"></noscript></div><p class="spiel-text">Dropcopy and FIX Routing out of the box, no extra costs.</p><p class="spiel-text">Neither are connections to new exchanges.</p><p class="spiel-text">Break free from your vendor lock-in with Fix8Pro and UFE.</p></div><div xs="0" class="col-sm-0 col-md-0 col-lg-2 col-xl-2"></div><div class="spiel-left spiel col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-5 col-xl-5"><h3>CME AutoCert+ certified</h3><div class="spiel-icon-container"><img alt="Certificate" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg fill='none' viewBox='0 0 480 480' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cfilter id='__svg-blur-4721eb0b3cef688c1bee72f695e09f0b'%3e%3cfeGaussianBlur in='SourceGraphic' stdDeviation='40'/%3e%3c/filter%3e%3c/defs%3e%3cimage x='0' y='0' filter='url(%23__svg-blur-4721eb0b3cef688c1bee72f695e09f0b)' width='480' height='480' xlink:href='data:image/svg%2bxml%3bbase64%2ciVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAEAAAABACAYAAACqaXHeAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAGB0lEQVR42u1ba2wVRRSebblt8VFQlEApihARYoL8aKJiwCJqqA%2bwiUpIaI02FWwBMYoGqCZiQmIUUIMkgICgRCPSQo2KPFJQeQgoMdEohtpSjH/kIUYhKHg94/1OPBl399677W53l7vJl707OzM755szZ86cmatU7kp7WYT8GCKjK%2b8C6Ny0wpcQniOsJzQRGnGPCpqBjXheQ5icac/fQjhOSMYQmwgJN7W4lNCBzAcIswh1hHrcwwzdxmmEp0QHfkqoIswmHEXai3YEsIGYgkw/EHpFdIzfBBnOE5YQpoKY7Ug/aleoB%2b7zkGkFngs9WNoEyhXgng24TMLDdwvR5lkZDIW0BCyP4IzAWjwDMvxIWIrOXI77OsITfhHAduRqwgTCeEJFlhiPsiM6QUAdZFifTeGuIIAbMKcLrHWTUacXAriOAsjByPeLAM77IOEbwi7C3iyxC2UbOtEBdV5IjJMNyBGQIyBHQNcRwOmlhMOYW1tDAu2t/kK4TVh73wgYHOIFzn3Ca%2b1yArhwEaGcMDZE0O25g9DHkOGCtAGWXzaAC19BeIOwUty7G9q3f4dwA9qY8NMGXBtiGzApCBvQC%2b8acPcbDcB0wpMIz5l55hJeQOf4pgHdbQPuJPTrThuQZ%2bTxAwmHNi1CW04RRj